    {
      "flavor_text": "おおぜいの　むれで　こうどうする。\nしっぽを　つなぎあわせて　わっかを\nつくる。ゆうじょうの　しるしらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "많은 무리로 행동한다.\n꼬리를 맞잡아 원을 만든다.\n우정의 표시인 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils vivent en grandes colonies et relient leurs\nqueues pour former un anneau en signe d’amitié.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie leben in großen Kolonien und verbinden\nihre Schweife in Freundschaft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habitan en grandes colonias y forman anillos uniendo\nsus colas, aparentemente en signo de amistad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vivono in colonie numerose e formano anelli\nlegando le loro code in segno di amicizia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They work in large colonies and make rings by\nlinking their tails, apparently in friendship.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大勢の　群れで　行動する。\n尻尾を　つなぎ合わせて　輪っかを\n作る。友情の　印らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habitan en grandes colonias y forman anillos uniendo\nsus colas, aparentemente en signo de amistad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "２ほんの　しっぽで　きのみの　からを\nきように　むいて　たべる。ほんものの\nうでは　ほとんど　つかわなくなった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "2개의 꼬리로 나무열매 껍질을\n솜씨 좋게 벗겨 먹는다. 진짜\n팔은 거의 쓰지 않게 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit de noix qu’il épluche avec ses deux\nqueues habiles. Il utilise de moins en moins ses bras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es hungrig ist, knackt es Nüsse mit seinen\nbeiden Schweifen. Nur selten verwendet es die Arme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para comer, rompe nueces con sus dos colas.\nRaras veces utiliza sus brazos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nutre di nocciole che sbuccia con le due code.\nRaramente usa le sue vere braccia.",
